WEBVTT

00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:06.685
You built the business. Would it run without you?

00:00:08.576 --> 00:00:11.950
CriticalDash shows what's proven, and what's still a guess.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.045
Test the riskiest guesses first.

00:00:23.609 --> 00:00:27.369
Your team sends results from their phone. No password.

00:00:28.851 --> 00:00:32.392
Every decision goes on the record, with the reason why.

00:00:34.685 --> 00:00:37.691
What works becomes a runbook anyone can follow.

00:00:39.718 --> 00:00:41.802
So you can see what runs without you.

00:00:48.918 --> 00:00:51.509
CriticalDash. By Incrementic.
